#. USD mesh import, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:187.
msgid ""
"Import ``UsdGeomMesh`` primitives as :doc:`Mesh Objects "
"</modeling/meshes/index>`."
msgstr ""
"Importera ``UsdGeomMesh``-primitiver som :doc:`meshobjekt "
"</modeling/meshes/index>`."

#. USD OpenVDB volume import, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:189.
msgid ""
"Import ``UsdVolVolume`` OpenVDB assets as :doc:`Volume Objects "
"</modeling/volumes/index>`."
msgstr ""
"Importera ``UsdVolVolume``-OpenVDB-tillgångar som :doc:`volymobjekt "
"</modeling/volumes/index>`."

#. USD point cloud import, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:191.
msgid ""
"Import ``UsdGeomPoints`` primitives as :doc:`Point Cloud Objects "
"</modeling/point_cloud/index>`."
msgstr ""
"Importera ``UsdGeomPoints``-primitiver som :doc:`punktmolnsobjekt "
"</modeling/point_cloud/index>`."

#. USD shapes heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:192.
msgid "USD Shapes"
