#. USD material purpose heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:205.
msgid "Material Purpose"
msgstr "Materialsyfte"

#. USD allPurpose material option, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:209.
msgid "Attempt to import ``allPurpose`` materials."
msgstr "Försök att importera ``allPurpose``-material."

#. USD preview material option, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:210.
msgid ""
"Attempt to import ``preview`` materials. Load ``allPurpose`` materials as"
" a fallback."
msgstr ""
"Försök att importera ``preview``-material. Läs in ``allPurpose``-material "
"som reserv."

#. USD full material option, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:211.
msgid ""
"Attempt to import ``full`` materials. Load ``allPurpose`` or ``preview`` "
"materials, in that order, as a \"fallback.\""
msgstr ""
"Försök att importera ``full``-material. Läs in ``allPurpose``- eller "
"``preview``-material, i den ordningen, som reserv"

#. USD preview importer heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:252.
msgid "Import USD Preview"
msgstr "Importera USD Preview"

#. USD preview shaders, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:253.
msgid "Convert USD Preview Surface shaders to Principled BSDF shader networks."
msgstr "Konvertera USD Preview Surface-shaders till Principled BSDF-shadernätverk."

#. USD texture resolution behavior, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:279.
msgid ""
"Don't import textures. Note that, with this option, material textures may"
" fail to be resolved in Blender."
msgstr ""
"Importera inte texturer. Observera att materialtexturer kanske inte kan "
"hittas i Blender med det här alternativet."

#. USD texture directory heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:283.
